# ESP32-S3 CAM, colour kit (esp32s3cam-color): applied on top of
# sdkconfig.defaults and sdkconfig.s3cam.
#
# The ST7789 panel is the only SPI master on this board, and with the SPI
# master ISR in IRAM it pulls about 8.6 KB of driver code into IRAM, which on
# the S3 comes out of the same internal SRAM as the heap. With Bluetooth on,
# that left too little internal RAM for the UI task's 20 KB stack and the
# board booted to a dark UI ("Failed to create UI task", 2026-11-10).
#
# Out of IRAM, the panel's transfers simply wait while flash is being written
# (NVS saves): a screen update can be a few milliseconds late, nothing more.
# The panel's pre-transfer callback stays IRAM_ATTR; it is a few bytes.
CONFIG_SPI_MASTER_ISR_IN_IRAM=n
